From: OfficeDroid contributors
Subject: [PATCH] wineandroid: present GDI pixels through public NativeWindow APIs

Android 16 buffers reject the legacy gralloc module's handle and lock methods.
Share a Wine CPU section with the JVM process, and let ANativeWindow_lock and
ANativeWindow_unlockAndPost use Android's actual buffer mapper. This also avoids
transferring private Android graphic handles between Wine processes.
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, like the modified Wine files.

